{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Move slowly. Look closely. In this world, the silence speaks, and what hides in the stillness is watching you too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There are no puzzles, jump scares, or goals.. there's only you... and your camera. Only the most patient are able to hunt down the ethereal beings of the other world(s).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by old computer hunting games... players can earn points upon successfully capturing a creature on camera. And spend those points on more dangerous maps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Level Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All levels are &quot;assembled&quot; using the in-house game engine created in Raylib.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experienced players are able to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use any model they want for the &quot;<strong>creature_model&quot; </strong>and the &quot;<i><strong>env_model</strong></i>&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign an unlock price for their maps (maximum: 1000 pts)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjust the behavior of creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the texture/sound/model for almost any visual asset used in a map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game uses morph keys for variety. No advanced knowledge of modeling topics required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638830/extras/about_modding1.png?t=1746396990\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638830?t=1746396990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638830?t=1746396990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta